{
	"_note": "Event name -> sound. file is under data/audio/, bus is one of the buses in default_bus_layout.tres, volume_db trims the file, cooldown is the least number of seconds between two plays of the event, so a month of events does not become noise. Replace any file with your own of the same name (tools/make_audio.py writes the stock ones).",
